WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:05.900
Yes, she seems to be getting by.

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:09.360
She was even acting as an assistant to 
one of her senpais the other day.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.850
I see.

00:00:10.850 --> 00:00:15.100
I know she's determined, 
but she's just so weak emotionally.

00:00:15.610 --> 00:00:17.680
What about with the others?

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:18.740
Is she getting along with them?

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.200
Yes...

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.420
She's getting along with the other girls.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.670
She's totally fine.

00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:28.100
Not to mention, it looks like 
they're going out today,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.610
to the art supply store.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.090
You're so cute with your hair up, Kaos-chan!

00:00:36.090 --> 00:00:38.310
Th-This is a first for me.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.290
It's my first time going 
to a big one, too!

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:42.840
I'm so excited!

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.020
Apparently there's a whole
building that's an art supply store!

00:00:43.310 --> 00:00:45.070
<i>By themselves?</i>

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:48.980
No... Tsubasa-chan and 
Ruki-chan will be with them.

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.980
That sounds really intimidating..

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.610
All right, let's go to the dungeon 
where the legendary item awaits!

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:56.700
<i>I see. That's good to hear.</i>

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:58.790
Tsu-chan, no cosplaying today.

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.050
Wear your normal clothes.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.630
All right, off we go!

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.400
Okay!

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:26.270
Comic Girls

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.930
<i>Now approaching Shinjuku.</i>

00:03:02.860 --> 00:03:05.060
I-I'm being swept away!

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:07.830
Kaos-chan!

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.710
Koyume-chan!

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.210
Kaos-chan!

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:20.980
Tsu-chan!

00:03:20.980 --> 00:03:22.680
You saved me!

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:25.640
Fee             165 yen 
Remaining 523 yen

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.480
We made it out somehow.

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.780
You okay?

00:03:31.590 --> 00:03:33.650
The city is scary...

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.290
Um...

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:45.920
Hm?

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:48.660
The big book store...

00:03:49.590 --> 00:03:51.750
I'd like to go check it out.

00:03:56.570 --> 00:03:58.630
Is this whole place...

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:00.900
New Bunko Volumes

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.010
Just for comics?

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:06.840
Snow Flower

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:07.560
Super Exciting 
Paradise

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:09.850
Pretty Highness

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:06.100
That's Sumomo Hatayama-sensei's 
<i>Super Exciting Paradise</i>,

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.600
and Mizuki Hana-sensei's <i>Pretty Highness</i>!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.850
Oh, and this one!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:12.440
It's a mountain of treasures...

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.560
Legit Dark Fantasy 
The New Star everyone's been waiting for:

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:13.560
Wing V

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:14.620
Is this...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.900
#1 The Dark Castle Crumbles                                    Wing V

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:18.110
Tsubasa-san's book?!

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.510
Well... Yeah.

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:21.830
That's amazing! It's on display face up!

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.730
And it's even got a flashy pop ad!

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:26.530
I-I-I-I'm so amazed!

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.620
This is incredible, Tsubasa-san!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.370
New Volumes

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:30.740
I'm going to buy some right now!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:33.110
What? But there are copies back at the dorm...

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:35.970
No! It'd be pointless unless 
I bought them myself!

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:37.090
Me, too!

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:45.470
We're going to make another stop before 
we get to our final destination.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.010
Hey, this place...

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:54.200
But I thought only high 
school girls could go in here!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.860
Kaos-chan, you're a high school girl, too.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:02.660
I want to hurry up and go 
to the art supply store.

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:06.350
But you get so worked up while 
you're there that you get dizzy.

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:08.820
We need to make sure you eat something first.

00:05:09.130 --> 00:05:11.610
Not to mention, we have first-timers with us.

00:05:11.610 --> 00:05:12.820
True.

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:15.650
I love crêpes!

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:20.660
There are so many menu 
choices just for crêpes?

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.800
I personally recommend... This one!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.860
O-Okay....

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.060
It's so cute...

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:33.900
Am I really allowed to eat this?

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:36.240
You want a bite of mine?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.280
I couldn't!

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.230
What?

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.810
Kaos-chan, you haven't eaten at all.

00:05:45.810 --> 00:05:48.080
I think my heart is full...

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:51.150
Here. Say, "Aah."

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:56.420
So good.

00:05:57.910 --> 00:06:00.210
Wow, it's so huge!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.070
This whole building is an art supply store?

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:07.490
Well, they do carry stuff 
other than manga supplies.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:11.110
Is there something you'd like to buy?

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:15.700
I'd like a complete set of supplies so 
I can help as an assistant at any time.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.600
All right, let's buy the necessities first.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.780
All right.

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.770
<i>I guess they're all used to this.</i>

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.300
<i>I need to make sure I'm not 
the only one panicking.</i>

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:29.820
What's wrong, Tsubasa-san?! 
Wait! Please wait!

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:32.070
Tsu-chan's always like that...

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:33.490
Wow! There are so many things!

00:06:33.490 --> 00:06:35.670
I wonder where Tsubasa-san went.

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.380
Oh, there she is.

00:06:38.210 --> 00:06:39.660
They have new products.

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:40.490
I want to try them out.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:43.790
I've never seen Tsubasa-san's 
face look so sparkly!

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.010
It happens once in a while.

00:06:45.880 --> 00:06:48.820
Like when she discovers a 
really interesting manga...

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.990
Rukki! Rukki! Look, look, look!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:06:53.810
Or when we're at an autograph session 
for a manga artist she likes.

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:56.080
Maybe you should calm down a bit.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:58.100
She loves manga so much, it's adorable!

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:01.280
This looks cool,

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.660
but it doesn't seem very practical.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:04.270
You look so cool with a quill!

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:09.680
So cool!

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.490
You look so strong!

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.430
I'm buying these.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.450
<i>Tsu-chan's so hyper all of a sudden.</i>

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:17.200
That should be enough ink for a while.

00:07:17.200 --> 00:07:19.910
As for pen tips...

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:21.160
This one.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:23.040
I'll get that one, too!

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:26.670
Koyume, easy-to-use supplies 
differ from person to person.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:30.200
F-For me, I feel the most motivated

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.050
when I use the same supplies as you.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:33.970
Want to try it?

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:34.510
Yes!

00:07:34.660 --> 00:07:37.970
For blood splatters, if you go <i>sploosh</i> like this...

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:39.720
it turns out pretty well.

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:40.690
I see!

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:42.980
Like this? <i>Splash</i>!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.980
Would you ever even use that in shojo manga?

00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.400
Ooh, there are new screen tones out.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.050
You're right! That one's really cute!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:15.140
Whenever they come out 
with new flower designs,

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:16.900
I always end up buying them!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.420
<i>For one piece dresses...</i>

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:22.810
<i>For underwear...</i>

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.640
<i>That's what I'll use it on!</i>

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.850
This looks like one you 
can use, Koyume-chan.

00:08:29.010 --> 00:08:30.400
You think so?

00:08:32.160 --> 00:08:33.610
<i>This one's intense!</i>

00:08:33.890 --> 00:08:35.810
<i>That definitely fits Tsu-chan...</i>

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:41.240
<i>That suits you way too much, Kaos-chan!</i>

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:46.620
<i>There's a lot of nudity in my next 
manuscript, so I'll buy extra.</i>

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:51.260
Where are you going to use all of 
those sheets of bubbly splotches?

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.750
Wh-Wh-Where?

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.280
Th-The protagonist of my manga 
gets stung by bugs a lot!

00:08:57.280 --> 00:08:58.680
Way to go, Ruki-san!

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:00.390
I see you're a stickler for reality!

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:02.100
This is painful, Rukki.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:08.320
There are so many varieties 
of masking tape, too!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:10.820
So cute!

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:13.050
They even have wide ones and thin ones.

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:15.710
They're really convenient, 
so it doesn't hurt to have a lot.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.730
Oh, right.

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:20.440
Kaos-chan, you don't use them 
since you draw digitally.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:23.160
Sorry, this probably doesn't make much sense.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:24.110
Oh, it's fine.

00:09:24.600 --> 00:09:27.000
Why are these useful?

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.650
You can use them as hair ties... and stuff.

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:32.020
Huh?! But that sounds like it'd hurt!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:33.940
I'm kidding.

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.260
We use this to make sure our 
manuscript stays in place.

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:42.380
They're really cute, so I 
think I'll buy some, too.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:42.900
Yeah!

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.490
Let's choose some for everyone.

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:47.020
This one with the donuts reminds 
me of you, Koyume-chan.

00:09:47.020 --> 00:09:49.310
Then this kitty one is for you, Kaos-chan.

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.470
I think a bird design would suit Tsubasa-san.

00:09:51.470 --> 00:09:55.090
For Ruki-san, something sexy, like 
leopard print or high heels.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.230
Oh, this one with the 
kiss marks is good, too.

00:09:57.230 --> 00:10:00.300
<i>Just choose some cute ones for me, too!</i>

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.970
I think this pen will work.

00:10:01.970 --> 00:10:04.410
I'm not really sure.

00:10:04.820 --> 00:10:06.410
Isn't this it?

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.810
Are you drawing manga for the first time?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:08.780
Huh? Yes.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.490
This pen isn't for beginners,

00:10:11.490 --> 00:10:12.740
so you should pick this one instead.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.530
<i>Tsubasa-san is so kind!</i>

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:18.290
Wait, are you manga artists?

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:22.320
Yes, though we're new.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.790
Hopefully you can grow up 
to be a manga artist, too.

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.310
Let's all work hard!

00:10:29.530 --> 00:10:30.910
R-Right!

00:10:34.760 --> 00:10:37.170
You bought a lot, Koyume-chan.

00:10:37.170 --> 00:10:40.050
I ended up using most of my allowance.

00:10:40.050 --> 00:10:42.090
That comes to 2,850 yen.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:43.660
Huh?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:45.310
Oh...

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:47.970
I bought Tsubasa-san's books and a crêpe...

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.970
You don't have enough?

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.420
Maybe I'll give up on the masking tape.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:55.380
Oh, I'll buy it, then.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:56.290
Huh?

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:58.620
You helped me with my manuscript 
the other day, so...

00:10:58.620 --> 00:11:00.780
But that was for my own education...

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:01.350
Don't worry about it.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:02.970
You, too, Kaos.

00:11:04.710 --> 00:11:06.790
So cool!

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:08.970
So mature!

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.100
<i>The art supply store was so much fun...</i>

00:11:20.590 --> 00:11:23.660
<i>And somehow I feel...</i>

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.310
<i>that I should work harder.</i>

00:11:34.010 --> 00:11:35.860
It's morning...

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:39.100
We ended up talking all night.

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:43.530
I think I might sleep a bit.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:46.360
<i>Now that Golden Week is over,</i>

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:49.620
<i>there should be a lot of people 
heading back to work and school.</i>

00:11:49.620 --> 00:11:52.100
<i>I hope people aren't being 
affected by the May blues.</i>

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:54.400
Wait! School starts back up today!

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.410
<i>And here's today's horoscope.</i>

00:11:54.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Episode 2 
"Back to School"

00:11:54.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Kaos-chan, 
how long 
does this 
usually 
take you?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Hey, hey! 
Which one's 
cuter?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:12:00.990
Hurghburbpth 
(We won't 
make it 
in time!)

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:59.240
<i>First place today is Libra!</i>

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:00.990
<i>Look forward to some unexpected luck!</i>

00:12:03.490 --> 00:12:06.920
<i>My new school uniform is so cute!</i>

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:09.250
<i>I feel like a manga protagonist.</i>

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.000
You ready?

00:12:15.290 --> 00:12:18.290
Oh, Kaos-chan, your uniform is so cute.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:20.010
No, no. I'm just a background character!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.510
I got ahead of myself!

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:22.510
Wait, what, Kaos-chan?!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.960
I'm late! I'm late!

00:12:27.740 --> 00:12:30.260
<i>Everything about her is a shojo manga.</i>

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.100
By the way, you two are basically 
transfer students, right?

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.420
Yes. I'm so nervous.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.060
Tsubasa-chan, you're as cool as ever.

00:12:53.060 --> 00:12:55.260
That T-shirt is so 
fashionable and lovely.

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.540
Thanks.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:12:59.920
I knew Tsubasa-san would be popular!

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.880
Tsu-chan, did you always 
have that T-shirt?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:04.880
This morning,

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.380
I spilled ink all over it.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:07.920
Go and get changed!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:13.100
Do you keep the fact that you draw 
manga a secret from everyone at school?

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:13.980
Yeah.

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.280
It'd be embarrassing if anyone 
spread rumors about me.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:19.400
I mean... considering 
the kind of manga I draw...

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.000
It'd be a huge deal if people found out.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.230
Hey, that's Ruki-san from class 1!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.090
She's really pretty, 
but hard to approach.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:28.440
She always seems busy after school 
and I don't think she gets enough sleep.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:31.380
I heard that she has a sketchy job...

00:13:31.380 --> 00:13:34.000
Yeah, I can totally see that.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:37.600
Um... Are you sure 
people haven't found out?

00:13:37.600 --> 00:13:38.530
They haven't found out!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:40.300
And I'm not sketchy!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.670
Faculty Room

00:13:44.730 --> 00:13:46.000
What's wrong?

00:13:46.000 --> 00:13:49.250
I'm getting nervous, 
thinking about my introduction.

00:13:49.250 --> 00:13:51.670
You don't need to think 
too hard about it.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.010
It'll be over in no time.

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:53.860
Not to mention,

00:13:53.860 --> 00:13:56.010
I'll be there with you, so you'll be fine.

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:57.350
Koyume-chan...

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.350
No worries!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.090
Yeah,

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:00.810
we're with you, too.

00:14:00.810 --> 00:14:01.680
Huh?

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:03.820
Huh?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.280
Huh?!

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:07.700
So you though we were older?

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:08.970
Because we look old?

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:10.430
No, no, no, no!

00:14:10.430 --> 00:14:13.010
Anyway, now you don't need 
to be so formal with us.

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:13.780
Okay?

00:14:15.210 --> 00:14:17.560
We're going to start class now.

00:14:17.560 --> 00:14:18.290
Yes, ma'am.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:20.090
So cute!

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:27.830
You're even cuter with this!

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:31.450
You're one of the transfer 
students, aren't you?

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:33.500
Hurry up and get to class!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:35.310
That goes for you two, as well.

00:14:35.310 --> 00:14:37.260
That's our homeroom teacher, Nijino-sensei.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:39.150
She's rather strict, despite how she looks.

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.080
See? Scary, right?

00:14:41.490 --> 00:14:44.370
I want to be scolded by the 
beautiful teacher, too...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.520
Really?!

00:14:47.650 --> 00:14:49.740
Okay, Kaos-chan, let's go!

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:52.340
Oh, Koyume-chan, 
you're in a different class.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:53.320
Huh?

00:14:54.590 --> 00:14:56.910
The three of us are together.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.620
D'oh!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:05.380
Please don't forget me!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:11.380
Kaoruko Moeta

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:11.700
All right, please introduce yourself.

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:15.820
I'm Kaoruko Moeta.

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:17.730
It's nice to meet you all.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:21.490
<i>I hope it goes that smoothly.</i>

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.560
<i>I haven't used my real name in a while!</i>

00:15:24.560 --> 00:15:29.820
Kaoruko Moeta

00:15:24.790 --> 00:15:26.100
<i>Wait, how do I pronounce it?</i>

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:27.650
<i>Is it Moeta, or Moe</i>ta<i>?</i>

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.820
<i>Um, and Kaoruko...</i>

00:15:32.010 --> 00:15:33.740
<i>Everyone's staring at me!</i>

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:36.450
M-Moe... Moe...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.000
M-M-M-M-Moe... Moe...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:43.910
Moe Moe Moe...

00:15:43.910 --> 00:15:46.540
<i>Kaos-chan, you're coming off as a weirdo.</i>

00:15:47.300 --> 00:15:48.410
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.660
I'm Kaoruko Moeta.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.920
It's nice to meet you all.

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:07.390
Is she okay?

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:09.910
Her seat's far away, so I'm worried.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.440
She froze up holding a screen tone hera.

00:16:18.440 --> 00:16:19.620
Oh...

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:22.460
She must've brought her 
pen case for assistant work.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:24.290
What's that?

00:16:32.770 --> 00:16:34.810
Now she's holding 
it like Prince Shotoku!

00:16:34.810 --> 00:16:36.510
She's not fooling anyone.

00:16:37.960 --> 00:16:39.890
You're so small, Moeta-san.

00:16:39.890 --> 00:16:41.130
How tall are you?

00:16:41.130 --> 00:16:42.300
Where did you come from?

00:16:42.850 --> 00:16:43.920
What are your hobbies?

00:16:43.920 --> 00:16:45.080
<i>My hobbies...</i>

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:48.540
<i>are to watch or read anime 
and manga with a lot of girls in them,</i>

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:50.390
<i>collecting figures...</i>

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:52.740
<i>But I can't say that!</i>

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.220
Who are your favorite celebrities?

00:16:54.220 --> 00:16:55.120
<i>Celebrities?!</i>

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.910
<i>Do voice actors count as celebrities?</i>

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.000
<i>How about characters from idol anime?!</i>

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:59.280
Hey, what about fashion?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:00.330
What styles do you like?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.560
<i>Fashion?! Do you mean cosplay?!</i>

00:17:02.560 --> 00:17:04.170
<i>I usually just observe...</i>

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:06.080
Um...

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.590
What kind of clubs were you in?

00:17:07.590 --> 00:17:09.360
Cl-Clu...

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:13.090
Kao... Kaoruko-chan?!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.050
Nurse's Office

00:17:15.050 --> 00:17:17.010
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:27.810
Are you okay, Kaos-chan?

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:30.170
Yes, I'm fine now.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:32.790
I was so worried!

00:17:32.790 --> 00:17:33.900
Koyume!

00:17:33.900 --> 00:17:35.520
Let's go to lunch!

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.740
Okay!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.890
I'll see you later!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:44.200
Where should we eat lunch?

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:44.380
She fit right in...

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:45.520
Let's go to the terrace!

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.010
There's a terrace? Let's go!

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:08.530
I'm so scared of people I don't know...

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:11.540
Do you want me to ask the teacher 
if we can sit near each other?

00:18:11.540 --> 00:18:14.250
Ruki-san, thank you so much.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.200
Hearing that makes me really happy.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:23.210
I appreciate the sentiment, but, 
um, wouldn't that be a bother?

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.700
Of course not!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.750
But, but... Aren't I being a bur—

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:31.430
It's fine! You can definitely ask more of me!

00:18:31.430 --> 00:18:32.430
I'm sorry.

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:35.030
The way you said that is a bit lewd, Ruki-san.

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:35.800
Hey.

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:38.470
I don't think you have to force 
yourself to talk to people.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:39.500
Huh?

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.430
You'll only be able to meet this many 
people while you're in school.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:46.610
Just think of it as people watching 
for creating manga.

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:54.430
But it's like, how much should you really eat, right?

00:18:54.430 --> 00:18:54.940
Yeah.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.110
It's all you can eat.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:01.070
I was told in a survey before...

00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:05.300
"I've never seen such an unrealistic 
high school girl in my life.

00:19:05.300 --> 00:19:08.540
The author should try to 
observe reality a little more."

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:10.800
I think that's because

00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:14.540
I've always been so scared to step foot

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:17.500
into the world of normal high school girls.

00:19:18.930 --> 00:19:20.890
Right...

00:19:20.890 --> 00:19:25.530
If I think of it as people watching 
for the sake of creating manga...

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.140
Thank you.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:30.960
I think I can be more 
positive about it now.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:35.980
And I never have to worry about 
the variety of my enemy characters!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.510
Whoa! So macho!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.900
People watching?

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:46.280
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:48.280
Kaos-chan!

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:50.030
I was so lonely without you!

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.100
Me, too, Koyume-chan!

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.250
Bye-bye, Koyume-chin.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.750
See you tomorrow!

00:19:58.080 --> 00:19:59.750
I'm sorry...

00:19:59.750 --> 00:20:02.680
For a moment, I thought that 
we might be the same...

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.510
Don't look so sad!

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:07.270
You make friends pretty fast, Koyume-chan.

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:10.800
I'm a little jealous that you look 
like you're having so much fun.

00:20:10.800 --> 00:20:12.520
What were you guys talking about?

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:15.470
I never had a chance to hear about 
relationships from girls who have boyfriends.

00:20:15.470 --> 00:20:17.650
I think it'll help with my manga.

00:20:17.650 --> 00:20:18.910
I see.

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:20.310
That's good.

00:20:20.310 --> 00:20:21.730
Yes!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.620
I got to hear all kinds 
of specific stories.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:28.310
Sorry we couldn't be of much help with that...

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:30.120
Yeah, sorry...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.120
No!

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.090
You two don't need to get sad, too!

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:44.020
So you didn't tell people at school

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:46.880
that you were a manga 
artist, either, Koyume-chan?

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:49.820
I want to be a normal 
high school girl at school.

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:52.390
Yeah, that's what I thought, too.

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:55.810
I want to make a lot of 
memories wearing this uniform.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.240
Yeah.

00:20:57.240 --> 00:21:00.510
Not to mention, we can all talk 
about manga back at the dorm,

00:21:00.510 --> 00:21:02.450
and that's a lot of fun, too.

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:06.010
I'm really glad that
I joined the dorm, too.

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:20.920
Nice to meet you.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:29.230
She's quick to make friends with animals.

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:30.430
Yeah.

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:31.520
That's a talent.

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:42.970
You're so nervous...

00:21:42.970 --> 00:21:46.110
You must've been through 
some really scary things.

00:21:48.860 --> 00:21:51.110
You're such a failure!

00:21:53.620 --> 00:21:55.000
Kaos-chan...

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.480
...is holding a kitten 
that looks just like her...

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:00.130
The cuteness is unbearable!

00:23:30.530 --> 00:23:32.160
You're so cute, Kaos-chan!

00:23:32.160 --> 00:23:33.320
Lovely!

00:23:33.320 --> 00:23:34.620
You're cute, too!

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:36.000
Now I'm really getting into it!

00:23:35.760 --> 00:23:39.980
Jiggle Jiggle Bounce

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:39.210
Next time, "Jiggle Jiggle Bounce."
